{"711840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Johnny Chainsaw", "steam_appid": 711840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Johnny Chainsaw is a single player puzzle platformer where players don’t have a jump button. Immerse yourself in this world of power structures, ethical dilemmas, and struggles in responding to change.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Jump Button</h2>Use the world to navigate obstacles and levels. How can you use the world to cross this gap without a jump button?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.poster.avif?t=1680040927\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.webm?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.mp4?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode: A discovery at the center of the planet, a response hampered by power struggles, and the inevitable change that threatens the world. You decide what happens to the inhabitants of Corut and how their lives will be forever changed.<br></li><li>Standard mode: Complete the game without story mode elements. Perfect for streaming, speedrunning, or enjoying weird platforming mechanics without narrative screens interrupting game flow.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 short levels<br></li><li>6 boss fights<br></li><li>Death counter and timer<br></li><li>Collectables<br></li><li>Character Sheets<br></li><li>Rich story and Custscenes (story mode only)<br></li><li>Quick resets after character death - get right back in the action<br></li><li>Achievements</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide the Fate of the World (Story Mode Only)</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.poster.avif?t=1680040927\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.webm?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.mp4?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When Yarbor's lead researcher Ivan discovers a change at the planet's core, a power struggle ensues at the company. This conflict forever changes the lives of all mechanics and organics on Corut. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reveal Ivan's discovery<br></li><li>Explore the power struggle and its ramifications<br></li><li>Recognize your part in the this conflict<br></li><li>Resolve the conflict and change life on Corut forever</li></ul></h2></h2>", "about_the_game": "Johnny Chainsaw is a single player puzzle platformer where players don’t have a jump button. Immerse yourself in this world of power structures, ethical dilemmas, and struggles in responding to change.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Jump Button</h2>Use the world to navigate obstacles and levels. How can you use the world to cross this gap without a jump button?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.poster.avif?t=1680040927\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.webm?t=1680040927\" type=\